  "goodToKnow": "Die Resonanz is resonance in physics and music, and figuratively the response or reaction to something: Das Angebot stieß auf große Resonanz (met with a great response), positive Resonanz. It's popular in journalism and PR. The sociologist Hartmut Rosa made Resonanz a key concept for a good life: a responsive relationship with the world. Der Resonanzboden is a soundboard. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Resonanzen."
